# Cleanup mode (`/cleanup`)

When the user invokes **`/cleanup`**:

Follow [`.cursor/commands/cleanup.md`](../commands/cleanup.md): run `npm test`, lint/format when configured, `npm run build`, and report failures with fixes.

Do not refactor unrelated code during cleanup unless required to fix a failure.
